# Taking back a mana ability whose cost removes a counter (cantrip_engine::undo): Pentad Prism, cast with two Forests,
# has one charge counter (sunburst, green). Bot1 removes it for blue and takes that back: the counter is on the Prism
# again and the pool is empty.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Forest
Pentad Prism
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Pentad Prism.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Pentad Prism.Activate(Color: Blue)
? Bot1.Mana = {U}
? Bot1.Battlefield.Pentad Prism.Counters.Charge = (absent)
Bot1.Undo
